    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d137">

                <pb facs="0221" n="955" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg955"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Governor McIntire to
                        Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >State of Colorado</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Executive
                                Office, Denver</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic">January 15,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Further replying to your letter of December
                    27, 1895, I have the honor to transmit a copy of the letter of the district
                    judge of the third judicial district, in which district lies the county of
                    Huerfano. I <pb facs="0222" n="956" xml:id="pg956"/> have also had the opinion
                    of the attorney-general of this State to like effect with that contained in the
                    letter of Judge Northcutt. I am, on careful consideration, unable to form any
                    different opinion concerning the jurisdiction of a grand jury of any other
                    county than Huerfano County in the unfortunate matter under consideration.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. McIntire</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Governor.</hi></signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d137-a1.xml" xpointer="d137-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
